{"MaqraNumber":232.0,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":76,"SurahIndex":"076","VerseNumber":19,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞وَيَطُوفُ عَلَيۡهِمۡ وِلۡدَٰنٞ مُّخَلَّدُونَ إِذَا رَأَيۡتَهُمۡ حَسِبۡتَهُمۡ لُؤۡلُؤٗا مَّنثُورٗا","TajweedText":"۞ وَيَطُوفُ عَلَيْهِمْ وِلْد<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>نٌ م</tajweed>ُّخَلَّدُونَ إِذَا رَأَيْتَهُمْ حَسِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>تَهُمْ لُؤْلُ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ؤًا م</tajweed>َّ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نث</tajweed>ُورًا <span class=end>١٩</span>","End":"١٩","PageNumber":579,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":514,"MaqraNumber":232,"HizbNumber":58,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":76,"SurahIndex":"076","VerseNumber":20,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِذَا رَأَيۡتَ ثَمَّ رَأَيۡتَ نَعِيمٗا وَمُلۡكٗا كَبِيرًا","TajweedText":"وَإِذَا رَأَيْتَ ثَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ رَأَيْتَ نَعِي<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مًا و</tajweed>َمُلْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>كًا ك</tajweed>َبِيرًا <span class=end>٢٠</span>","End":"٢٠","PageNumber":579,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":514,"MaqraNumber":232,"HizbNumber":58,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":76,"SurahIndex":"076","VerseNumber":21,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"عَٰلِيَهُمۡ ثِيَابُ سُندُسٍ خُضۡرٞ وَإِسۡتَبۡرَقٞۖ وَحُلُّوٓاْ أَسَاوِرَ مِن فِضَّةٖ وَسَقَىٰهُمۡ رَبُّهُمۡ شَرَابٗا طَهُورًا","TajweedText":"عَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِيَهُمْ ثِيَابُ سُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ند</tajweed>ُسٍ خُضْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٌ و</tajweed>َإِسْتَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>رَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>قٌ‌ۖ و</tajweed>َحُلّ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> أَسَاوِرَ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ف</tajweed>ِضَّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةٍ و</tajweed>َسَقَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ رَبُّهُمْ شَرَا<tajweed class=ikhafa>بًا ط</tajweed>َهُ